<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Browning-Ferris raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Browning-Ferris raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Browning-Ferris Industries Inc to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Browning-Ferris gained 5/8 to 29-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
